<li>Pustaha 4301-dipunsimpen ing &lt;a href="Logan%20Museum%20of%20Antropology"&gt;Logan Museum of Antropology&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Beloit"&gt;Beloit&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wisconsin"&gt;Wisconsin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
<li>Pustaha 12332-dipunsimpen ing &lt;a href="%C3%9Cbersee-Museum"&gt;Übersee-Museum&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bremen"&gt;Bremen&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;. Pustaha punika isinipun cara ngawonaken mengsah (poda ni si aji mamis).</li>
<li>Sanèsipun punika ugi wonten koleksi pustaha-pustaha cekak ingkang dipunsimpen ing pabukon &lt;a href="Universitas%20Princeton"&gt;Universitas Princeton&lt;/a&gt;.</li>
</ul>
