<doc id="98604" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=98604" title="Yuen Biao">
Yuen Biao

Yuen Biao (#ALIH) inggih punika salah satunggaling aktor saking &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun gadhah kawegigan ingkang mirunggan wonten ing seni bela diri kungfu lan sampun nyambut damel kirang langkung wonten ing 80 filem minangka aktor, stuntman lan koréografi aksi laga. Sesarengan kaliyan sadhèrèkipun lulusan saking Sekolah Opera &lt;a href="Peking"&gt;Peking&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sammo%20Hung"&gt;Sammo Hung&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jackie%20Chan"&gt;Jackie Chan&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun minangka salah satunggal saking anggota &lt;a href="Seven%20Little%20Fortunes"&gt;Seven Little Fortunes&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Taun - taun wiwitan</h2>
Taun - taun wiwitan.
Miyos minangka 夏令正 Xià Lìng-Zhèng (Hsia Ling-Jun) wonten ing nagara &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;, Yuen minangka anak kaping 5 saking 6 sadhèrèk. Piyambakipun ngangsu kawruh wonten ing China Drama Academy antawising umur 5 dumugi enem welas (16) taun, lan sasampunipun punika, piyambakipun ngrembakaken karieripun wonten ing donya perfileman &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Karier Film</h2>
<h3>Wiwitan 1970-an</h3>
Karier Film.
Wiwitan 1970-an.
Wonten ing wiwitan taun &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;an, Yuen wiwit nyambut damel minangka salah satunggaling &lt;a href="stunt%20performer"&gt;stuntman&lt;/a&gt; lan peran pambiyantu. Sasampuning mainaken peran wonten ing filem kanthi judhul &lt;a href="Fist%20of%20Fury"&gt;Fist of Fury&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Way%20of%20the%20Dragon"&gt;Way of the Dragon&lt;/a&gt;, Yuen dados satunggaling stunt kanggé &lt;a href="Bruce%20Lee"&gt;Bruce Lee&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing filem &lt;a href="Enter%20the%20Dragon"&gt;Enter the Dragon&lt;/a&gt;, taun &lt;a href="1973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun ugi minangka salah satunggaling "tiruan" saking &lt;a href="Bruce%20Lee"&gt;Bruce Lee&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing filem &lt;a href="Game%20of%20Death"&gt;Game of Death&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1978"&gt;1978&lt;/a&gt;), nindakaken manéka macem obahan akrobatik lan stunt ing pundi &lt;a href="Bruce%20Lee"&gt;Bruce Lee&lt;/a&gt; "&lt;a href="body%20double"&gt;body double&lt;/a&gt;" (&lt;a href="Taekwondo"&gt;Taekwondo&lt;/a&gt; expert, &lt;a href="Tai%20Chung%20Kim"&gt;Tai Chung Kim&lt;/a&gt;) boten saged nindakaken. Yuen tetep nyambut damel minangka satunggaling stuntman, lan ugi minangka satunggaling aktor wonten ing donya indhustri perfileman &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt;.
Wonten ing wiwitan peranipun, piyambakipun migunakaken nama panggung Bill Yuen kanggé filem-filem &lt;a href="Hong%20Kong"&gt;Hong Kong&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dipunédaraken kanggé kalangan internasional. Sesarengan kaliyan kasuksesanipun ingkang ndhèrèkaken &lt;a href="Jackie%20Chan"&gt;Jackie Chan&lt;/a&gt; kaliyan &lt;a href="Golden%20Harvest"&gt;Golden Harvest&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang gadhah nama sami, saéngga wonten ing credit title namanipun dipunserat minangka "Jimmy Yuen".
<h3>Pungkasan &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;an lan &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;an</h3>
Pungkasan &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;an lan &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;an.
Pungkasan taun &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;an lan awal-awal taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;an, berkat gayutan saénipun kaliyan kanca-kancanipun lan kanca satunggal kelasipun, &lt;a href="Sammo%20Hung"&gt;Sammo Hung&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Jackie%20Chan"&gt;Jackie Chan&lt;/a&gt;, piyambakipun wiwit nyambut damel kanthi rutin minangka &lt;a href="aktor"&gt;aktor&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampuning main minangka pemeran pambiyantu wonten ing filem &lt;a href="The%20Dragon%2C%20the%20Odds"&gt;The Dragon, the Odds&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1977"&gt;1977&lt;/a&gt;) lan peranipun minangka peran utama wonten ing &lt;a href="Knockabout%20%28filem%29"&gt;Knockabout&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1978"&gt;1978&lt;/a&gt;), piyambakipun wiwit misuwur lumantar sapéranngan filem sukses ing wiwitan taun &lt;a href="1980"&gt;1980&lt;/a&gt;an, salah satunggalipun ingkang asring dipunsebut inggih punika &lt;a href="The%20Prodigal%20Son%20%28filem%29"&gt;The Prodigal Son&lt;/a&gt; (dipunsutradarai déning &lt;a href="Sammo%20Hung"&gt;Sammo Hung&lt;/a&gt;) lan &lt;a href="Dreadnaught"&gt;Dreadnaught&lt;/a&gt; (dipunsutradarai déning &lt;a href="Yuen%20Woo-ping"&gt;Yuen Woo-ping&lt;/a&gt;). Lajeng piyambakipun ugi main sesarengan kaliyan "sadhèrèkipun" saking Sekolah Opera Peking, &lt;a href="Jackie%20Chan"&gt;Chan&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sammo%20Hung"&gt;Hung&lt;/a&gt;, wonten ing filem &lt;a href="Project%20A"&gt;Project A&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wheels%20on%20Meals"&gt;Wheels on Meals&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Dragons%20Forever"&gt;Dragons Forever&lt;/a&gt;. Kajawi punika piyambakipun ugi medal wonten ing sapérangan peran alit wonten ing sapérangan filem kados ta &lt;a href="Sammo%20Hung"&gt;Hung&lt;/a&gt; trilogi &lt;a href="Lucky%20Stars"&gt;Lucky Stars&lt;/a&gt;.
