San Antonio Spurs

San Antonio Spurs inggih punika tim bal &lt;a href="basket"&gt;basket&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing salebeting &lt;a href="National%20Basketball%20Association"&gt;National Basketball Association&lt;/a&gt; ingkang dumunung wonten ing &lt;a href="San%20Antonio%2C%20Texas"&gt;San Antonio, Texas&lt;/a&gt;. Klub punika sampun menangken kejuaraan NBA kaping 4, nalika taun &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
Klub punika wiwitanipn gadhah nama Dallas Chaparrals wonten ing &lt;a href="American%20Basketball%20Association"&gt;American Basketball Association&lt;/a&gt; (ABA) nalika taun &lt;a href="1967"&gt;1967&lt;/a&gt;. Lajeng dipun-gantos dados Texas Chaparrals wonten ing mangsa tetandhingan &lt;a href="1970"&gt;1970&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1971"&gt;1971&lt;/a&gt;. Wonten ing taun &lt;a href="1973"&gt;1973&lt;/a&gt; Spurs dipuntumbas déning sakelompok pangusaha saking San Antonio ingkang kasusun langkung saking 36 tiyang, dipunpimpin déning &lt;a href="Angelo%20Drossos"&gt;Angelo Drossos&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Red%20McCombs"&gt;Red McCombs&lt;/a&gt; lan dipunsukani nama San Antonio Spurs.
Tim punika wiwit dados salah satunggaling tim kuat wonten ing Wewengkon Barat nalika wonten ing masa &lt;a href="George%20Gervin"&gt;George Gervin&lt;/a&gt;, pasipun wonten ing taun &lt;a href="1976"&gt;1976&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;. Spurs dados tim langganan mlebet playoff lan asring dados juara divisinipun, nanging déréng naté mlebet dhateng Final NBA, sasampuning kawon déning tim kados Washington Bullets, &lt;a href="Boston%20Celtics"&gt;Boston Celtics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Houston%20Rockets"&gt;Houston Rockets&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles%20Lakers"&gt;Los Angeles Lakers&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampuning masa Gervin, Spurs mlebet ing masa-masa ingkang sisah lan Spurs naté kaancem pindhah kutha amargi cacahing penonton mandhap drastis dipunétang saking &lt;a href="1985"&gt;1985&lt;/a&gt;. Spurs wiwit manggihaken malih kejayaan kanthi wontenipun &lt;a href="David%20Robinson"&gt;David Robinson&lt;/a&gt; ing Spurs. Spurs asring malih nuju playoff lan dados juara divisinya, nanging Spurs dèrèng naté ngraosaken Final NBA.
Mlebetipun Tim Duncan dhateng San Antonio Spurs saèstu mbekta berkah. Sesarengan kaliyan David Robinson, kekalihipun mbentuk "menara kembar" ingkang dipunajrihi wonten ing NBA. Duèt punika kasil mbekta Spurs dados juara NBA kanggé kapisanaipun taun &lt;a href="1999"&gt;1999&lt;/a&gt;. Duèt punika dipuntambah &lt;a href="Tony%20Parker"&gt;Tony Parker&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Manu%20Ginobili"&gt;Manu Ginobili&lt;/a&gt;, Spurs saged mlebet NBA malih nalika taun &lt;a href="Final%20National%20Basketball%20Association%202003"&gt;2003&lt;/a&gt;. Sasampuning final, Robinson pénsiun saking NBA. Éwadéné makaten, Spurs taksih saged dados juara NBA kaping 2, inggih punika wonten ing taun &lt;a href="Final%20National%20Basketball%20Association%202005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Final%20National%20Basketball%20Association%202007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;). Kanthi asringipun Spurs dados juara NBA, kathah tiyang nganggep bilih punika sampun mbiyag dinasti énggal ing NBA.
