<doc id="99008" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=99008" title="Walt Disney Animation Studios">
Walt Disney Animation Studios

Walt Disney Animation Studios, ingkang gadhah kantor pusat ing &lt;a href="Burbank%2C%20California"&gt;Burbank, California&lt;/a&gt;|Burbank]], &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt; lan lajeng misuwur minangka Walt Disney Feature Animation lan Walt Disney Production inggih punika salah satunggaling studio animasi ing &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ingkang asring damel fitur filem animasi, filem cekak lan ing TV spesial kanggé &lt;a href="The%20Walt%20Disney%20Company"&gt;The Walt Disney Company&lt;/a&gt;. Déné studio punika inggih minangka unit péranganing &lt;a href="The%20Walt%20Disney%20Studios%20%28production%20company%29"&gt;The Walt Disney Studios&lt;/a&gt;. Studio punika kapanggih ing tanggal &lt;a href="16%20Oktober"&gt;16 Oktober&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1923"&gt;1923&lt;/a&gt; minangka studio kartun Disney Brothers, nanging sampun kagabung kaliyan Walt Disney Productions ing taun &lt;a href="1929"&gt;1929&lt;/a&gt;. Studio filem punika sampun damel ugi &lt;a href="Prat%C3%A9lan%20filem%20ing%20Walt%20Disney%20Animation"&gt;Pratélan filem ing Walt Disney Animation&lt;/a&gt;http://www.disneyanimation.com/studio/history ingkang dipunwiwiti kanthi filem &lt;a href="Snow%20White%20and%20the%20Seven%20Dwarfs%20%281937%20filem%29"&gt;Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs&lt;/a&gt; (1937), lan filem ingkang paling misuwur ingggih punika &lt;a href="Wreck-It%20Ralph"&gt;Wreck-It Ralph&lt;/a&gt; (2012). 
Animasi subjek ingkang cekak saking aun &lt;a href="1934"&gt;1934&lt;/a&gt; ingkang wonten ing fitur operasi animasi inggih aslinipun sampun kagabung aliyan péranganing bisnis, lan divisi &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney%20Pictures"&gt;Walt Disney Pictures&lt;/a&gt; maujud ing taun &lt;a href="1950"&gt;1950&lt;/a&gt; kanggé mrodhuksi filem live-action. Ing salebeting The Walt Disney Company sampun dipunwontenaken restrukturisasi perusahaan ing taun &lt;a href="1986"&gt;1986&lt;/a&gt;, lajeng Walt Disney Production kanthi resmi dados anak perusahaan saking perusahaan ingkang gadhah nama Animasi Fitur Walt Disney. Lajeng studio ngéwahi nama studionipun ingkang kados sapunika ing taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt;.
<h2>Sajarah</h2>
Sajarah.
&lt;a href="Kansas%20City"&gt;Kansas City&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Missouri"&gt;Missouri&lt;/a&gt; naté nyathet bilih &lt;a href="Walt%20Disney"&gt;Walt Disney&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Roy%20O.%20Disney"&gt;Roy O. Disney&lt;/a&gt; ingkang madegaken Disney Brothers Cartoon Studio wonten ing &lt;a href="Los%20Angeles"&gt;Los Angeles&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt; ing taun &lt;a href="1923"&gt;1923&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang sampun mrodhuksi kathah rerangkèn filem kados ta Alice Comedies ingkang ngetngalaken aktris live action laré-laré ing dunya animasi. Alice Comedies punika inggih dipunsebaraken déning &lt;a href="Margaret%20J.%20Winkler"&gt;Margaret J. Winkler&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing &lt;a href="Winkler%20Pictures"&gt;Winkler Pictures&lt;/a&gt;, ingkang ing wekdal samangke ugi dipunsebaraken déning disney ingkang kaping kalih ingkang damel cariyos ingkang cekak, kados ta ingkang sedayanipun dipundamel animasi inggih punika filem &lt;a href="Oswald%20the%20Lucky%20Rabbit"&gt;Oswald the Lucky Rabbit&lt;/a&gt;, kalebet Universal Pictures ingkang dipunwiwiti taun &lt;a href="1927"&gt;1927&lt;/a&gt;. Studio Disney dipundhirikaken wonten ing kantor toko ing Kingswell Avenue wonten ing punjering kitha Los Angeles ngantos dumugi pindhah dhateng gedhong ingkang énggal ingkang dipunyasa ing sak nginggiling &lt;a href="2719"&gt;2719&lt;/a&gt; Hyperion Avenue.
<h2>Fitur Film</h2>
Fitur Film.
Walt Disney Animation Studios sampun mbikak &lt;a href="52"&gt;52&lt;/a&gt; filem ingkang misuwur wonten ing Disney Animation Canon. Saben filem dipunparingi nomer ingkang nedahaken urutan kronologis bilih saben filem punika sampun dipunrilis mlebet wonten ing kanon filem kalebet filem &lt;a href="Snow%20White%20and%20the%20Seven%20Dwarfs%20%281937%20filem%29"&gt;Snow White and the Seven Dwarfs&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Fantasia%20%28filem%29"&gt;Fantasia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Cinderella%20%281950%20filem%29"&gt;Cinderella&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lady%20and%20the%20Tramp"&gt;Lady and the Tramp&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="The%20Little%20Mermaid%20%281989%20filem%29"&gt;The Little Mermaid&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Beauty%20and%20the%20Beast%20%281991%20filem%29"&gt;Beauty and the Beast&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Aladdin%20%281992%20Disney%20filem%29"&gt;Aladdin&lt;/a&gt;. Film sanèsipun ingkang dipunwedalaken déning Disney Animation inggih kalebet &lt;a href="Tangled"&gt;Tangled&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Winnie%20the%20Pooh%20%28filem%29"&gt;Winnie the Pooh&lt;/a&gt;. Fitur sanèsipun ingkang sampun dipunwedalaken déning studio punika inggih &lt;a href="Wreck-It%20Ralph"&gt;Wreck-It Ralph&lt;/a&gt;, satunggaling filem ingkang ngengingi arcade games, ingkang badhé dipunwedalaken ing sasi &lt;a href="Nov%C3%A8mber"&gt;Novèmber&lt;/a&gt; 2012. Projek studio ingkang salajjengipun inggih punika &lt;a href="Frozen%20%282013%20filem%29"&gt;Frozen&lt;/a&gt;, satunggaling filem adhaptasi musik saking &lt;a href="Hans%20Christian%20Andersen"&gt;Hans Christian Andersen&lt;/a&gt; cariyosipun &lt;a href="The%20Snow%20Queen"&gt;The Snow Queen&lt;/a&gt;", dipunangkah saged dipunwedalaken ing sasi &lt;a href="Nov%C3%A8mber"&gt;Novèmber&lt;/a&gt; 2013.
