Fil Pinokio inggih dipunadapsi déning Aurelius Battaglia, William Cottrell, Otto Englander, Erdman Penner, Joseph Sabo, &lt;a href="Ted%20Sears"&gt;Ted Sears&lt;/a&gt;, lan Webb Smith saking buku Collodi. Prodhuksi filem punika dipunsupervisi déning &lt;a href="Ben%20Sharpsteen"&gt;Ben Sharpsteen&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Hamilton%20Luske"&gt;Hamilton Luske&lt;/a&gt;, lan serial filemipun dipunsutradarai déning &lt;a href="Norm%20Ferguson%20%28animator%29"&gt;Norman Ferguson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="T.%20Hee"&gt;T. Hee&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Wilfred%20Jackson"&gt;Wilfred Jackson&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jack%20Kinney"&gt;Jack Kinney&lt;/a&gt;, lan Bill Roberts.
